  /// USA_HCPCS_CODE USA_NATIONAL_PROVIDER_IDENTIFIER USA_NATIONAL_DRUG_CODE
  /// USA_HEALTH_INSURANCE_CLAIM_NUMBER USA_MEDICARE_BENEFICIARY_IDENTIFIER
  /// USA_CPT_CODE PERSON_NAME DATE The Entity type group USA_ALL is also
  /// supported, and includes all of the above entity types except PERSON_NAME
  /// and DATE.
